# Personal Data Strategy

Use when issues involve:

- family contacts
- workplace contacts
- debt collection agencies
- personal information
- privacy concerns
- third-party disclosure

---

# Principle

Do not accuse.

Do not conclude a violation.

Do not conclude liability.

---

# Preferred Language

I do not consent to sharing this information with unrelated third parties.

Please ensure personal information is handled appropriately.

Please clarify how this information was obtained or used.

I reserve the right to pursue further complaint procedures if necessary.
